<title>BELGIUM: EU to tell UK BA/American deal must change.</title>
<headline>EU to tell UK BA/American deal must change.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission will tell the British government later on Tuesday it has concluded that the proposed alliance between British Airways and American Airlines would harm fair competition unless changed, a Commission source said.</p>
<p>European Competition Commissioner Karel Van Miert will meet British Trade and Industry Secretary Margaret Beckett in London and the two partners will also be informed shortly, the source said.</p>
</text>
